Error [jet.MissingDisplay]: The function `greet` has no `Display` implementation
  --> tests/ui/interpolation_hole_names_a_function.jet:6:16
    |
  6 |     print("<p>{greet}</p>")
    |                ^^^^^
 Why: A hole shows a value, and a function is code to run, not text
 Fix: Call it in the hole: `{greet()}`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0915
